@startuml 00-flow
' ============================================================
' 00-flow.puml  ——  整体大致流程
' 范围：启动 → 主循环 → 单帧 tick → 退出
' 不画：屏幕栈状态机、AudioEngine 通道、屏幕目录、IPlatform 适配细节
' ============================================================

title 整体运行时流程

participant "host main"         as Main
participant "ScreenRunner"      as Runner
participant "GameScreen (T)"    as Screen
participant "IPlatform"         as Platform

== 启动 ==

Main -> Runner : 构造(platform, BOOT, 50ms)
note right of Runner
  ctor 只设 _pending = SWITCH(BOOT)；
  首次 tick() 排空后真正 new BootScreen + enter()。
end note

== 主循环 ==

loop 直至窗口关闭
  Main -> Platform : process_events()
  Main -> Runner    : tick()
  Main -> Platform : delay_to_next_frame(50ms)
end

== 单帧 tick() ==

group tick()
  Runner -> Platform : input().poll()
  Runner -> Screen   : update(platform, *this)
  Runner -> Screen   : render(platform, *this)
  note right of Screen
    屏幕可在 update 内发起：
    switch_to / push_screen / pop_screen。
    三者延迟到本帧末 _apply_pending() 才改栈。
  end note
  Runner -> Platform : audio.fill_buffer() + write_audio_samples()
  Runner -> Platform : display().present()
end

== 退出 ==

Main --> Main : return 0

@enduml
